109
00:24:55,160 --> 00:25:00,860
[SPEAKER_00] Rast mišića s povećenim unosom, rast mišiće s manjenim unosom...

110
00:25:00,860 --> 00:25:01,700
[SPEAKER_01] Ugljikohidrata?

111
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:02,700
